+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
+//! The outline icon at the left of each settings row, as Windows 11 shows
+//! one on almost every row. Chosen from the row's title by keyword, so it
+//! works on every COSMIC page without editing them. Titles are matched in
+//! English; in other languages rows simply have no icon.
+
+/// Keyword (lower case, anywhere in the title) → Fluent icon. Earlier
+/// entries win, so specific phrases come before general words.
